OL,3,GNEWSA'We want to educate not prosecute
OL,4,Agood drivers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force is offering motorists
OL,7,Fcaught speeding, using mobile phones,
OL,8,For not wearing their seatbelt, the
OL,9,Fchance to immediately take a short
OL,10,Fsafety course when they are stopped.
OL,12,FOperation Wheeled Respect from
OL,13,FGloucestershire Constabulary and the
OL,14,Fcounty's roads safety partnership is an
OL,15,Falternative to a fine or points on the
OL,16,Flicence.
OL,18,FEmily Booker, from the safety
OL,19,Fpartnership, explained "for many
OL,20,Fdrivers it's a moment of poor
OL,21,Fjudgement, so we don't want to
OL,22,Fprosecute otherwise good drivers.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
